WEBVTT

00:09:17.371 --> 00:09:20.704
So maybe you remember on the
last season of Zig-Zag,

00:09:20.704 --> 00:09:24.079
I had a fabulous conversation
with Chaplain Greg Epstein.

00:09:24.662 --> 00:09:29.121
Greg is the humanist chaplain at MIT and
Harvard and he writes about tech

00:09:29.121 --> 00:09:33.121
and ethics. And we got super
deep into resetting.